# Signing material. Never in the repo — a Developer ID .p12 is the private key that
# lets anyone ship software as you, and this repo is public. It lives in the login
# keychain and in the DEVELOPER_ID_P12 repo secret; a copy on disk is a copy too many.
*.p12
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
